":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-15T14:25:30Z","updated_at":"2026-03-15T14:25:30Z","body":"> Are there any performance concerns with the added level of indirection?\r\n\r\nGood question. Theoretically yes, but `ClassDB` is so slow with the locks and the hash lookups I don't think it will have an impact.\r\nStill, it's a good opportunity to clean up, so I optimized the iteration functions where possible with the `GDType` idiomatic version. Should be faster than the previous implementation, even with the indirection.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4063097666/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4063274406","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117442#issuecomment-4063274406","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117442","id":4063274406,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7yMKWm","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-15T15:55:03Z","updated_at":"2026-03-15T15:55:10Z","body":"While you're tweaking GDType, clangd `unused-includes` warnings from your previous PR to fix:\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/core/object/gdtype.cpp b/core/object/gdtype.cpp\r\nindex f7aa5128ad..b6466674e5 100644\r\n--- a/core/object/gdtype.cpp\r\n+++ b/core/object/gdtype.cpp\r\n@@ -30,9 +30,7 @@\r\n \r\n #include \"gdtype.h\"\r\n \r\n-#include \"core/object/class_db.h\"\r\n #include \"core/os/thread.h\"\r\n-#include \"core/variant/variant.h\"\r\n \r\n GDType::GDType(const GDType *p_super_type, StringName p_name) :\r\n \t\tsuper_type(p_super_type), name(std::move(p_name)) {\r\ndiff --git a/core/object/gdtype.h b/core/object/gdtype.h\r\nindex 91efcd4265..82af035142 100644\r\n--- a/core/object/gdtype.h\r\n+++ b/core/object/gdtype.h\r\n@@ -32,7 +32,6 @@\r\n \r\n #include \"core/string/string_name.h\"\r\n #include \"core/templates/a_hash_map.h\"\r\n-#include \"core/templates/local_vector.h\"\r\n #include \"core/templates/vector.h\"\r\n \r\n class GDType {\r\n```\r\n\r\nThose creep in fast :D","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4063274406/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4063601036","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117442#issuecomment-4063601036","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117442","id":4063601036,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7yNaGM","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-15T18:25:41Z","updated_at":"2026-03-15T18:28:59Z","body":"On my end `target=template_release production=yes` Linux builds had a 32B decrease in binary size.\r\n\r\nAnd on Bunnymark stress tests (which I believe is sensible to a single line modification in `ClassDB`), there was a 0.45% improvement in FPS. Out of 4 parallel tests, 3 *very close* wins, 1 loss.\r\n\r\nFor those with concerns about performance, I think this answers the question.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4063601036/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4066905910","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117442#issuecomment-4066905910","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117442","id":4066905910,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7yaA82","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-16T11:12:47Z","updated_at":"2026-03-16T11:12:47Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4066905910/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]